   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The data below show the top ten scorers (by points per game) in the National Basketball Association for the 2018–2019 season. Find the mode, median, and mean age of these players without technology.\n<table><caption>(source: https://www.basketball-reference.com/leagues/NBA_2019_leaders.html)</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Rank</th>\n<th>Player</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>James Harden</td>\n<td>29</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Paul George</td>\n<td>28</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Giannis Antetokounmpo</td>\n<td>24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Joel Embiid</td>\n<td>24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Stephen Curry</td>\n<td>30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Devin Booker</td>\n<td>22</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Kawhi Leonard</td>\n<td>27</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Kevin Durant</td>\n<td>30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>Damian Lillard</td>\n<td>28</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Bradley Beal</td>\n<td>25</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
